     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">\r\nHi,\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Thanks for your patient and I apologize for the errors you encountered — they were due to the recent updates in CODEX2 leading to discrepancies. I’ve updated the tutorial as well as the R markdown. Please try again and feel free to let us know\r\n if you have further questions.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Yuchao</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div>On Jun 19, 2019, at 4:22 PM, Simoneaux, Tankya N &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">TN...@pitt.edu</a>&gt; wrote:</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\nGood Afternoon,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\nI have been working through all of the errors. However, I encountered one that really baffles me.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">\r\n<span>&lt;image.png&gt;</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-style:normal;font-var